        <activityName xml:lang="en">Heavy fuel oil, burned in power plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Heavy fuel oil, burned in power plant
Emissions, materials use, infrastructure, etc. for oil input to power plants;
UUID: 80ffa5f0-5925-31de-ba60-9e6e4a80ac4d
All energy use, use of chemicals, emissions to air and water including treatment of flue gasses and effluents.
Location: Estimation for the country.
Technology: Estimation for average technology.
Time period: No new data for today situation thus assessment with older data and data for Europe.
Production volume: 4.9 TWh from power plants and 0.36 TWh from combined cycle plants.
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_80ffa5f0-5925-31de-ba60-9e6e4a80ac4d.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
